{"id":"000W7K","title":"Renban Lies","author":"marty_sears","solvedCount":6,"difficulty":4,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-24T12:40:05+00:00","posted":"Heute, 11:03 Uhr","rules":"Another collab episode! For this one, I worked with the fantastic Calvinball :)\n\nRules:\n\nNormal sudoku rules apply.\n\nLIAR CELLS: Every row, column and 3x3 box contains one liar cell, whose real value is different from its digit.\n\n• Every liar cell contains a different digit from 1-9.\n\n• Every liar cell has a different value from 1-9.RENBAN LINES: The VALUES on a pink line form a non-repeating set of consecutive digits, arranged in some order.\n\nBLACK DOTS: If a black dot sits between two cells, the value of one is double the value of the other.\n\nWHITE DOTS: If a white dot sits between two cells, their values are consecutive.\n\nX: If an X sits between two cells, their values sum to 10.\n\nNOTES: In each blue arrow, enter the liar digit for its row, and in the circle to its right, write its real value.\n\nLiar Cell puzzles by other setters:\n\nDuplicitous Arrows by Calvinball\n\nRobot Line Lies by raaaaa\n\nSplit Pea Lies by raaaaa\n\nLiar, Liar, Up to N’s on Fire by sujoyku\n\nEqualies by sujoyku\n\nThe Secret of Lying by sujoyku\n\nMeta Lies by sujoyku\n\nThe Digits Are Paid Actors by Lizzy01\n\nLiarr by ICHTUES\n\nChoco Banana Lies by berdy\n\nA Tendency To Lie by The Pi Guy\n\nThe Next To Lie by The Pi Guy","solutionCode":"VALUES in row 1, from left to right","tags":["Sudoku"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/41l9qcxxu0","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/41l9qcxxu0","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":11,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-24T12:40:05+00:00"}